ser","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-10-08T09:32:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T06:07:25Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T06:07:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot Version:\n- Reproducible in v4.8.dev7.official.c971f93e7\n- Not reproducible in v4.8.dev6.official.8898c2b3d\n\nOS:\n- Reproducible on macOS.\n- Not reproducible on Linux (Wayland).\n- I could not test it on Windows.\n\nIt also only happens with the game embedded in the Game workspace. It won't happen in a floating window.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev7 - macOS Tahoe (26.6.2) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (3360x2100 @ 60.00 Hz) - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 (Apple7) - Apple M1 (8 threads) - 8.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nPressing a key that is set as a some shortcuts for Canvas Item Editor will keep triggering a `pressed` event even after releasing the key.\n\nThe shortcuts I found causing this are:\n- Canvas Item Editor\n  - Select Mode\n  - Move Mode\n  - Rotate Mode\n  - Scale Mode\n  - Pan Mode\n\nChanging the shortcut will move the problem to the new key.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n\n1. Add this script to a node:\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nfunc _input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n\tif event is InputEventKey:\n\t\tprint(event.as_text(), \" pressed=\", event.pressed)\n```\n2. Run the game embedded in the editor\n3. Press one of the keys set as shortcut for the modes listed in the issue description (default `Q`, `W`, `E`, `R`, `G`)\n4. The output will be like:\n```\nQ pressed=true\nQ - Physical pressed=true\nQ pressed=false\nQ - Physical pressed=true\nQ - Physical pressed=true\nQ - Physical pressed=true\nQ - Physical pressed=true\nQ - Physical pressed=true\nQ - Physical pressed=true\n```\n5. Any other key will print only this:\n```\nA pressed=true\nA pressed=false\n```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124280/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124280/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}